      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Windows · Mac: wide layout; the window narrows to the one-column flow below 1024px. Conversations can pop out to their own window.\niPad: wide layout (split view). iPhone: narrow flow only; details open as a sheet over the conversation, not a third screen.\nQuest: list beside conversation as separate panels; no details panel — the pull request opens in a browser panel.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, panel, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles and layout.* widths in tokens/. Colours here are greys on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Windows · Mac: wide layout; the window narrows to the one-column flow below 1024px. Conversations can pop out to their own window.\niPad: wide layout (split view). iPhone: narrow flow only; details open as a sheet over the conversation, not a third screen.\nQuest: list beside conversation as separate panels; no details panel — the pull request opens in a browser panel.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, panel, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles and layout.* widths in tokens/. Colours here are greys on purpose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
